{"_note":"首页顶部 v3(对齐设计稿):品牌行 + **单行内联**概览条 —— 「6 关注中 · 2 今日事件 · ↑3.1K 新评分 · [US ▾]」数字与标签同行,US 收成右侧 chip。分组起点用比例锚(({parent.w}-76pt)*N/100),窄机(内容宽 311pt)不与 chip 相撞。新评分带昨日基线才亮涨色,无基线灰 --(两个 op:if 各写纯色双分支 —— $[if] 求色与 浅|深 切分的求值顺序无先例背书)。\n⚠️ 页头(§1):大标题 24pt + 右上角**带底胶囊**的时效锚;副标那一行由紧接其下的概览条承担 —— 它**就是**「此刻的状态」,再补一行文字复述等于渲两遍。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"brand","type":"txt","x":"0pt","y":"3pt","w":"{parent.w}-90pt","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.brand}","fontSize":"24pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#0E1116|#F3F4F6","maxLines":"1"},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${at}),0),1,0)]"},"react":[{"id":"at","type":"txt","x":"{parent.w}-{at.w}","y":"0pt","w":"-1","h":"26pt","alignmentV":"1","maxLines":"1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${at},--)]","fontSize":"12pt","typeface":"System","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","bgColor":"#0E0E1116|#14F3F4F6","paddingLeft":"26pt","paddingRight":"10pt","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"13pt","leftB":"13pt","rightT":"13pt","rightB":"13pt"},"events":{"onClick":"@[file://page/flow/refresh-home.af]"}},{"id":"atIc","type":"path","x":"{at.x}+8pt","y":"{at.y}+6.5pt","w":"13pt","h":"13pt","viewBox":"0 0 256 256","d":"M224,48V96a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H168a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h28.69L182.06,73.37a79.56,79.56,0,0,0-56.13-23.43h-.45A79.52,79.52,0,0,0,69.59,72.71,8,8,0,0,1,58.41,61.27a96,96,0,0,1,135,.79L208,76.69V48a8,8,0,0,1,16,0ZM186.41,183.29a80,80,0,0,1-112.47-.66L59.31,168H88a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H40a8,8,0,0,0-8,8v48a8,8,0,0,0,16,0V179.31l14.63,14.63A95.43,95.43,0,0,0,130,222.06h.53a95.36,95.36,0,0,0,67.07-27.33,8,8,0,0,0-11.18-11.44Z","fillColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B"}]},{"id":"strip","type":"layer","x":"0pt","y":"34pt","w":"{parent.w}","h":"44pt","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"14pt","leftB":"14pt","rightT":"14pt","rightB":"14pt"},"bgColor":"#FFFFFF|#15171A"},{"id":"n0","type":"txt","x":"14pt","y":"34pt","w":"-1","h":"44pt","alignmentV":"1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${total},0)]","fontSize":"15pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#0E1116|#F3F4F6","maxLines":"1"},{"id